warning[F0712]: this `Bool` expression can be simpler
  --> test/cli/commands/mutate_list.fren:58:60
   |
58 |     ensure exclusive: at_most_one?(x = 1, x = 2, x = 3) or exactly_one?(x > 3)
   |                                                            ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `exactly_one?` of one argument is that argument
   |
   = help: `fren fix` can fix this
   = note: `nonminimal_bool` is `warn` by default
   = help: to allow it, `set_option fren.lint.nonminimal_bool "allow"`
help: write `x > 3`
   |
58 -     ensure exclusive: at_most_one?(x = 1, x = 2, x = 3) or exactly_one?(x > 3)
58 +     ensure exclusive: at_most_one?(x = 1, x = 2, x = 3) or x > 3
   |

